SLLM patch 5/5: a failed Metal command buffer is reported to sllm-core (with Metal's error) and no longer leaves the
backend in a permanent error state. Against llama.cpp b11669 (source tarball 620d222) after patches 1-4, applied with patch -p1 in ggml/.

--- a/src/ggml-metal/ggml-metal-context.h
+++ b/src/ggml-metal/ggml-metal-context.h
